# Probabilistic Context-Free Grammar in Chomsky Normal Form
# Format: probability	LHS	RHS (space-separated)
# Binary rules: two nonterminals. Lexical rules: single terminal.
# Probabilities for each LHS sum to 1.
1.0	S	NP VP
0.5	VP	V NP
0.2	VP	VP PP
0.3	VP	V PP
0.6	NP	Det N
0.3	NP	NP PP
0.1	NP	N N
1.0	PP	P NP
0.5	Det	the
0.5	Det	a
0.3	N	dog
0.2	N	cat
0.3	N	park
0.2	N	fish
0.5	V	saw
0.5	V	ate
0.5	P	in
0.5	P	with
